  "dialogueList": [
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "73df8d9c-a274-48fd-98c9-2bd0d7860e83"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_MissionStart",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "所以我们只要走进去站着不动就行？这活听起来像胡扯。我想学怎么开枪，不是站着发呆！",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Contract_TrainingDay_1",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "我不清楚，这任务听着挺适合我。总之，为了开好这东西我还需要更多的练习。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Contract_TrainingDay_5",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "让我们确定这座基地没有防备。指挥官，前往这个位置，你应该就能看到基地了。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "181efcdf-0e34-477b-8a06-39b0ead2d69e",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "我们能炸掉一些建筑吗？",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Contract_TrainingDay_2",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "76b654a6-4f2c-4a6f-86e6-d4cf868335fe",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "4011a4c3-cba2-4d22-b2b3-3b19a3297ab9"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_MissionSuccess",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "好吧...这真是一次难忘的经历。达吕斯，我觉得这种任务我们该收取危险津贴。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "别说啦，梅耶尔。结局不错，我们也拿到了钱。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
